  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice apple into thin strips. Cut firm tofu into 2cm cubes.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine tofu and Asian BBQ seasoning.<br>• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, sesame seeds and a splash of water. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a8c92924105eca9f90/step-d1e53a00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins.<br>• Remove from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a8c92924105eca9f90/step-e8d2d610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine slaw mix and apple. Add a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar and toss to coat. Season to taste.<br>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a8c92924105eca9f90/step-3018ce20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Build tacos by spreading the mayonnaise over tortillas, then filling with slaw and tofu to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a8c92924105eca9f90/step-ff313a30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
